                                "sense_id": "2a2f4308-7640-3277-94a9-89ec4767d1a3",
                                "text": "Since its inception in the late 19th century, cheerleading has evolved from yelling encouragement on the sidelines to a competitive hybrid of gymnastics, dance and acrobatics."
